IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `ar-income-tax-rates`

-- Ark. Code 26-51-201(a)(3) -- worked cases, from the seat of the individual taxpayer.
-- Every expected value was worked out by hand from the tables in the Act (formulas sidecar), never copied from the
-- encoding's output. The taxpayers are HYPOTHETICAL. Amounts are US dollars of net income.

-- Table A (net income $89,600 or less).
-- $5,000: within the 0% row.
#ASSERT `What is my Arkansas tax on my net income` 2025 5000 EQUALS `answered` 0
-- $10,000: 2% of the $4,701 over $5,299 = $94.02.
#ASSERT `What is my Arkansas tax on my net income` 2025 10000 EQUALS `answered` 94.02
-- $20,000: 2% of $5,300 = $106; 3% of $4,500 = $135; 3.4% of $4,901 = $166.634. Total $407.634.
#ASSERT `What is my Arkansas tax on my net income` 2025 20000 EQUALS `answered` 407.634
-- $50,000: $106 + $135 + 3.4% of $9,900 ($336.60) + 3.9% of $25,001 ($975.039) = $1,552.639.
#ASSERT `What is my Arkansas tax on my net income` 2024 50000 EQUALS `answered` 1552.639
-- $89,600, the top of table A: $106 + $135 + $336.60 + 3.9% of $64,601 ($2,519.439) = $3,097.039.
#ASSERT `What is my Arkansas tax on my net income` 2025 89600 EQUALS `answered` 3097.039

-- Table B with the bracket adjustment.
-- $89,650: 2% of $4,500 = $90; 3.9% of $85,150 = $3,320.85; less $310: $3,100.85.
#ASSERT `What is my Arkansas tax on my net income` 2025 89650 EQUALS `answered` 3100.85
-- $92,700: $90 + 3.9% of $88,200 ($3,439.80) = $3,529.80; less $10: $3,519.80.
#ASSERT `What is my Arkansas tax on my net income` 2025 92700 EQUALS `answered` 3519.8
-- $92,701: no adjustment; $90 + 3.9% of $88,201 ($3,439.839) = $3,529.839.
#ASSERT `What is my Arkansas tax on my net income` 2025 92701 EQUALS `answered` 3529.839
-- $100,000: $90 + 3.9% of $95,500 ($3,724.50) = $3,814.50.
#ASSERT `What is my Arkansas tax on my net income` 2025 100000 EQUALS `answered` 3814.5

-- The (C) table, row by row at its edges.
#ASSERT `What bracket adjustment do I get` 89600 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `What bracket adjustment do I get` 89601 EQUALS 310
#ASSERT `What bracket adjustment do I get` 89700 EQUALS 310
#ASSERT `What bracket adjustment do I get` 89701 EQUALS 300
#ASSERT `What bracket adjustment do I get` 91050 EQUALS 170
#ASSERT `What bracket adjustment do I get` 92601 EQUALS 10
#ASSERT `What bracket adjustment do I get` 92701 EQUALS 0

-- Outside the encoding: 2023.
#ASSERT `What is my Arkansas tax on my net income` 2023 50000 EQUALS `not covered` `the rate tables for tax years before 2024 are not deposited`
